{start_of_verse: Verse 1}
[F]The golden morning is fast [C7]ap[F]proaching; [C7]Jesus [F]soon [C7]will [F]come
[F]To take His faithful and hap[C7]py [F]children [C7]To their [F]prom[C7]ised [F]home.
[F]O, we see the gleams of the golden [Bb]morn[F]ing [C]Piercing [C7]through this [F]night of gloom!
[F]O, we see the gleams of the golden morning [C7]That will [F]burst [C7]the [F]tomb.
{end_of_verse}

